b/scxyyz.jpg"}, {"id": 1584972, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz0.jpg"}, {"id": 1584976, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz4.jpg"}, {"id": 1584981, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz9.jpg"}, {"id": 1584967, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyyv.jpg"}, {"id": 1584969, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyyx.jpg"}, {"id": 1584973, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz1.jpg"}, {"id": 1584974, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz2.jpg"}, {"id": 1584975, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz3.jpg"}, {"id": 1584977, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxyz5.jpg"}], "slug": "treeplanter", "storyline": "Welcome to Treeplanter, an interactive woodland that grows and changes with the seasons. Piece together a small grove of trees, branch by branch, and watch as their roots blossom under the soil!\n\nAs time goes by, an ecosystem of animals, plants and birds will move in, turning your creation into a living world. Changing seasons and weather will affect the miniature universe of your grove.\n\nBuild your grove in a variety of landscapes, from sunny meadows to ancient ruins. Combining meditation and education, Treeplanter aims to teach players about the interconnected wonders of the natural world, above and below ground.\n\nEach copy of the game sold helps Henry plant trees, wildflowers, meadows and community orchards, through partnerships with schools, farms, communities and woodland charities. Meaning you\u2019ll help restore real-life nature too!!", "summary": "Create and enjoy a peaceful, interactive woodland throughout the changing seasons.\nFor every copy sold, we plant a real tree!", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/treeplanter", "videos": [{"id": 156020, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "gXsxn1OWxM0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gXsxn1OWxM0", "title": "Treeplanter - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gXsxn1OWxM0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175991, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1ilTuNPlAPA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1ilTuNPlAPA", "title": "Treeplanter Demo Announcement", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1ilTuNPlAPA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186291, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "2iIS3lNcbew", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2iIS3lNcbew", "title": "Treeplanter - Official New Content Announcement Trailer | Women-Led Games x SGF 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2iIS3lNcbew/fhddefault.jpg"}]}